  "definitionVersion": "0.1.0",
  "title": "At-Least-Once Queue",
  "description": "Message queue with at-least-once delivery and no ordering guarantee, exactly as fixed by the edge.queue Interface. There is no ordering field: a FIFO queue is a different Form.",
  "role": "identity",
  "desiredSchema": {
